cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the data in it, please cite the paper below."
title: "Feasibility Pump with Objective Cutoff: reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Code, data and scripts behind the paper "Feasibility Pump with Objective
  Cutoff: A Computational Study": the patch chain and build recipe for the
  modified SCIP feasibility pump, the factorial campaign on MIPLIB 2017, the
  from-scratch pump prototype with its grid of runs, the target experiment on
  Gurobi, and the aggregators that regenerate every table and figure of the
  paper from the raw result files.
type: software
authors:
